The fork is modified by Chia Network for Chia HF2 timelord compatibility, shared
consensus encodings, candidate failure isolation, validated filter schedules and
dependency alignment. Each modification is a signed commit in the fork's Git
history. See VENDORING.md and upstream.toml for provenance.
The app maintains the native-client adapter and application lifecycle separately.

